    [box-a-MK] scheduler: env-gated TP-consistency probe (SGLANG_MK_TP_PROBE)
    
    Off unless SGLANG_MK_TP_PROBE=1. Every SGLANG_MK_TP_PROBE_EVERY (default 100)
    scheduler iterations every rank snapshots (iteration, forward_ct, sum of the
    running batch's seq lens, KV allocator available_size, crc32 of the sorted
    running rids, cumulative accepted spec tokens, cumulative verify count) before
    the request receive. TP rank 0's snapshot rides that iteration's existing
    request broadcast as one extra list element (no new collective); every rank
    strips it and compares: MK_TP_PROBE MISMATCH at ERROR (raises with
    SGLANG_MK_TP_PROBE_ASSERT=1), one MK_TP_PROBE ok line every 10 checks.

